  "section": "6.139",
  "rulesText": "A Tinderbox is a small container holding flint, fire steel, and tinder (usually dry cloth soaked in light oil) used to kindle a fire. Using it to light a Candle, Lamp, Lantern, or Torch - or anything else with exposed fuel - takes a Bonus Action. Lighting any other fire takes 1 minute."
}
